0514631, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc4MDUxNDYzMQ==", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-02-17T12:10:49Z", "updated_at": "2021-02-17T12:10:49Z", "body": "Better explain the error here than link to it, for the record. Those links may get unavailable after a while.\r\n\r\nThe problem is the following: when building MAVSDK in superbuild mode, CMake will build OpenSSL as part of the dependencies. On macOS, it succeeds in configuring but fails to build, with the following error message:\r\n\r\n```\r\n**********************************************************************\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n***   OpenSSL has been successfully configured                     ***\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n***   If you encounter a problem while building, please open an    ***\r\n***   issue on GitHub <https://github.com/openssl/openssl/issues>  ***\r\n***   and include the output from the following command:           ***\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n***       perl configdata.pm --dump                                ***\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n***   (If you are new to OpenSSL, you might want to consult the    ***\r\n***   'Troubleshooting' section in the INSTALL file first)         ***\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n**********************************************************************\r\n[ 75%] Performing build step for 'openssl'\r\n../openssl/apps/bf_prefix.c:10:10: fatal error: 'stdio.h' file not found\r\n#include <stdio.h>\r\n         ^~~~~~~~~\r\n../openssl/apps/s_cb.c:11:10: fatal error: 'stdio.h' file not found\r\n#include <stdio.h>\r\n         ^~~~~~~~~\r\n```", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/780514631/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/780515045", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1320#issuecomment-780515045", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1320", "id": 780515045, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc4MDUxNTA0NQ==", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-02-17T12:11:39Z", "updated_at": "2021-02-17T12:11:39Z", "body": "I think you are missing the `SDKROOT` environment variable to build OpenSSL. It is done [here](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/develop/.github/workflows/main.yml#L381) in the CI.\r\n\r\nCan you try something like below, and run a clean build again?\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport SDKROOT=$(xcrun --sdk macosx --show-sdk-path)\r\n```", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/780515045/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/780540222", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1320#issuecomment-780540222", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1320", "id": 780540222, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc4MDU0MDIyMg==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-02-17T13:00:27Z", "updated_at": "2021-02-17T13:00:27Z", "body": "This work fine for me:\r\n```\r\n[ 62%] Performing configure step for 'openssl'\r\nOperating system: x86_64-apple-darwinDarwin Kernel Version 20.3.0: Thu Jan 21 00:07:06 PST 2021; root:xnu-7195.81.3~1/RELEASE_X86_64\r\nWARNING! If you wish to build 32-bit libraries, then you have to\r\n         invoke 'KERNEL_BITS=32 /Users/julianoes/src/MAVSDK/build/default/third_party/openssl/openssl/src/openssl/config  '--prefix=/Users/julianoes/src/MAVSDK/build/default/third_party/install' 'no-shared''.\r\nConfiguring OpenSSL version 1.1.1h (0x1010108fL) for darwin64-x86_64-cc\r\nUsing os-specific seed configuration\r\nCreating configdata.pm\r\nCreating Makefile\r\n\r\n**********************************************************************\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n***   OpenSSL has been successfully configured                     ***\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n***   If you encounter a problem while building, please open an    ***\r\n***   issue on GitHub <https://github.com/openssl/openssl/issues>  ***\r\n***   and include the output from the following command:           ***\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n***       perl configdata.pm --dump                                ***\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n***   (If you are new to OpenSSL, you might want to consult the    ***\r\n***   'Troubleshooting' section in the INSTALL file first)         ***\r\n***                                                                ***\r\n**********************************************************************\r\n[ 75%] Performing build step for 'openssl'\r\nar: creating archive apps/libapps.a\r\nar: creating archive libssl.a\r\n```\r\n\r\n@norisg do you have the command line tools installed?\r\nI think `sudo xcode-select --install` should do it. I did that when `brew` told me to.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/780540222/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/780552089", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1320#issuecomment-780552089", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1320", "id": 780552089, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc4MDU1MjA4OQ==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.g